msgid "# Installation"
msgstr "# 安装"

msgid "This document describes how to install vllm-ascend manually."
msgstr "本文档介绍如何手动安装 vllm-ascend。"

msgid "## Requirements"
msgstr "## 环境要求"

msgid "There are two installation methods:"
msgstr "有两种安装方式："

msgid ""
"- **Using pip**: first prepare the environment manually or via a CANN image, then install `vllm-ascend` using pip.\n"
"- **Using docker**: use the `vllm-ascend` pre-built docker image directly."
msgstr ""
"- **使用 pip**：先手动或通过 CANN 镜像准备环境，然后使用 pip 安装 `vllm-ascend`。\n"
"- **使用 Docker**：直接使用 `vllm-ascend` 预构建的 Docker 镜像。"

msgid "## Configure Ascend CANN environment"
msgstr "## 配置昇腾 CANN 环境"

msgid ""
"Before installation, you need to make sure firmware/driver, and CANN are "
"installed correctly, refer to [CANN "
"Installation](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download?versionId=735&ids=d806%2Ch0501%2Ch0601%2Ch0702)"
" for more details."
msgstr ""
"安装前，需确保固件/驱动和 CANN 已正确安装，更多详情请参考[CANN "
"安装指南](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download?versionId=735&ids=d806%2Ch0501%2Ch0601%2Ch0702)。"

msgid "### Configure hardware environment"
msgstr "### 配置硬件环境"

msgid ""
"To verify that the Ascend NPU firmware and driver were correctly installed, "
"run:"
msgstr "要验证昇腾 NPU 固件和驱动是否正确安装，请运行："

msgid ""
"Refer to [CANN "
"Installation](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download?versionId=735&ids=d806%2Ch0501%2Ch0601%2Ch0702)"
" for more details."
msgstr ""
"更多详情请参考[CANN "
"安装指南](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download?versionId=735&ids=d806%2Ch0501%2Ch0601%2Ch0702)。"

msgid "### Configure software environment"
msgstr "### 配置软件环境"

msgid "=== \"Before using pip\""
msgstr "=== \"使用 pip 之前\""

msgid ""
"The easiest way to prepare your software environment is using CANN image "
"directly:"
msgstr "准备软件环境最简单的方法是直接使用 CANN 镜像："

msgid ""
"The CANN prebuilt image includes NNAL (Ascend Neural Network Acceleration "
"Library), which provides libatb.so for advanced tensor operations. No "
"additional installation is required when using the prebuilt image."
msgstr "CANN 预构建镜像包含 NNAL（昇腾神经网络加速库），该库提供 libatb.so 以支持高级张量运算。使用预构建镜像时无需额外安装。"

msgid "??? \"Click here to see 'Install CANN manually'\""
msgstr "??? \"点击此处查看'手动安装 CANN'\""

msgid "You can also install CANN manually:"
msgstr "您也可以手动安装 CANN："

msgid ""
"If you encounter \"libatb.so not found\" errors during runtime, please "
"ensure NNAL is properly installed as shown in the manual installation steps "
"below."
msgstr "如果在运行时遇到“找不到 libatb.so”的错误，请确保按照下方手动安装步骤正确安装了 NNAL。"

msgid "=== \"Before using docker\""
msgstr "=== \"使用 Docker 之前\""

msgid ""
"No extra steps are needed if you are using the `vllm-ascend` prebuilt Docker"
" image."
msgstr "如果您使用 `vllm-ascend` 预构建的 Docker 镜像，则无需额外步骤。"

msgid "Once this is done, you can start to set up `vllm` and `vllm-ascend`."
msgstr "完成上述步骤后，即可开始设置 `vllm` 和 `vllm-ascend`。"

msgid "## Set up using Python"
msgstr "## 使用 Python 进行设置"

msgid "First, install system dependencies and configure the pip mirror:"
msgstr "首先，安装系统依赖并配置 pip 镜像源："

msgid ""
"Then you can install `vllm` and `vllm-ascend` from a **pre-built wheel** "
"using one of the following methods:"
msgstr "然后，您可以通过以下任一方法从**预构建的 wheel 包**安装 `vllm` 和 `vllm-ascend`："

msgid "=== \"Original installation\""
msgstr "=== \"原始安装\""

msgid "=== \"uv-wheelnext installation\""
msgstr "=== \"uv-wheelnext 安装\""

msgid ""
"The `uv-wheelnext` installation downloads only the delta on top of vllm, "
"resulting in a smaller download size. First install `uv-wheelnext` to "
"support incremental wheels:"
msgstr ""
"`uv-wheelnext` 安装仅下载 vllm 之上的增量部分，从而减小下载体积。首先安装 `uv-wheelnext` 以支持增量 wheel "
"包："

msgid ""
"If you encounter errors during `uv pip install` (e.g., corrupted cache or "
"stale package data), try clearing the uv cache first and then re-run the "
"install command:"
msgstr "如果在 `uv pip install` 过程中遇到错误（例如缓存损坏或包数据过期），请先清除 uv 缓存，然后重新运行安装命令："

msgid "uv cache clean"
msgstr "uv cache clean"

msgid "??? \"Click here to see 'Build from source code'\""
msgstr "??? \"点击此处查看'从源代码构建'\""

msgid "or build from **source code**:"
msgstr "或从**源代码**构建："

msgid "To install `triton-ascend`, run:"
msgstr "要安装 `triton-ascend`，请运行："

msgid ""
"If you are installing via `uv`, make sure to install `triton-ascend` "
"**last**, after all other packages have been installed, to avoid dependency "
"resolution conflicts."
msgstr "如果通过 `uv` 安装，请确保在所有其他包安装完成**之后**再安装 `triton-ascend`，以避免依赖解析冲突。"

msgid ""
"If you are building custom operators for Atlas A3, you should run `git "
"submodule update --init --recursive` manually, or ensure your environment "
"has internet access."
msgstr ""
"如果为 Atlas A3 构建自定义算子，应手动运行 `git submodule update --init "
"--recursive`，或确保环境可以访问互联网。"

msgid ""
"If you are building in a CPU-only environment where `npu-smi` is "
"unavailable, you need to set `SOC_VERSION` before `pip install -e .` so the "
"build can target the correct chip. You can refer to `Dockerfile*` defaults, "
"for example:"
msgstr ""
"如果在无法使用 `npu-smi` 的纯 CPU 环境中构建，需要在 `pip install -e .` 之前设置 "
"`SOC_VERSION`，以便构建过程定位正确的芯片。您可以参考 `Dockerfile*` 中的默认值，例如："

msgid ""
"To enable the batch invariance feature, set `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1` before building vllm-ascend to install the batch invariance custom operator library during the installation process.\n"
"    For usage guidance on the batch invariance feature, see <https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/docs/source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md>"
msgstr ""
"要启用批量不变性特性，请在构建 vllm-ascend 前设置 `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1`，以便在安装过程中安装批量不变性自定义算子库。\n"
"    关于批量不变性特性的使用指南，请参见 <https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/docs/source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md>"

msgid "## Set up using Docker {: #set-up-using-docker }"
msgstr "## 使用 Docker 进行设置 {: #set-up-using-docker }"

msgid ""
"`vllm-ascend` offers Docker images for deployment. You can just pull the "
"**prebuilt image** from the image repository [ascend/vllm-"
"ascend](https://quay.io/repository/ascend/vllm-ascend?tab=tags) and run it "
"with bash."
msgstr ""
"`vllm-ascend` 提供了用于部署的 Docker 镜像。您可以直接从镜像仓库 [ascend/vllm-"
"ascend](https://quay.io/repository/ascend/vllm-ascend?tab=tags) "
"拉取**预构建镜像**，并使用 bash 运行它。"

msgid "Supported images as following."
msgstr "支持的镜像如下："

msgid "??? \"Click here to see 'Build from Dockerfile'\""
msgstr "??? \"点击此处查看'从 Dockerfile 构建'\""

msgid "or build IMAGE from **source code**:"
msgstr "或从**源代码**构建镜像："

msgid ""
"The default workdir is `/workspace`, vLLM and vLLM Ascend code are placed in"
" `/vllm-workspace` and installed in [development "
"mode](https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/userguide/development_mode.html) "
"(`pip install -e`) to help developers immediately make changes without "
"requiring a new installation."
msgstr ""
"默认工作目录为 `/workspace`，vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend 代码位于 `/vllm-"
"workspace`，并以[开发模式](https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/userguide/development_mode.html)（`pip"
" install -e`）安装，以帮助开发者立即进行修改，无需重新安装。"

