msgid "## Multi-node Deployment"
msgstr "## 多节点部署"

msgid ""
"### Verify Multi-Node Communication {: #verify-multi-node-communication }"
msgstr "### 验证多节点通信 {: #verify-multi-node-communication }"

msgid ""
"First, check physical layer connectivity, then verify each node, and finally"
" verify the inter-node connectivity."
msgstr "首先，检查物理层连通性，然后验证每个节点，最后验证节点间连通性。"

msgid "#### Physical Layer Requirements"
msgstr "#### 物理层要求"

msgid ""
"- The physical machines must be located on the same LAN, with network connectivity.\n"
"- All NPUs are connected with optical modules, and the connection status must be normal."
msgstr ""
"- 物理机器必须位于同一 LAN 中，且网络连通。\n"
"- 所有 NPU 均通过光模块连接，且连接状态必须正常。"

msgid "#### Each Node Verification"
msgstr "#### 每个节点验证"

msgid ""
"Execute the following commands on each node in sequence. The results must "
"all be `success` and the status must be `UP`:"
msgstr "在每个节点上依次执行以下命令。结果必须全部为 `success`，且状态必须为 `UP`："

msgid "#### Interconnect Verification"
msgstr "#### 互联验证"

msgid "##### 1. Get NPU IP Addresses"
msgstr "##### 1. 获取 NPU IP 地址"

msgid "##### 2. Cross-Node PING Test"
msgstr "##### 2. 跨节点 PING 测试"

msgid "### Run Container In Each Node"
msgstr "### 在每个节点中运行容器"

msgid ""
"Using vLLM-ascend official container is more efficient to run multi-node "
"environment."
msgstr "使用 vLLM-ascend 官方容器可以更高效地运行多节点环境。"

msgid ""
"Run the following command to start the container in each node (You should "
"download the weight to /root/.cache in advance):"
msgstr "运行以下命令在每个节点中启动容器（您应提前将权重下载到 /root/.cache）："

