msgid "### CPU-only build verification"
msgstr "### 仅CPU构建验证"

msgid ""
"CPU-only verification checks that the Python package can be built when no\n"
"Ascend device is visible. It does **not** validate NPU runtime loading,\n"
"inference examples, custom kernels, or NPU-specific tests. A CANN toolkit is\n"
"still required because the build reads its headers and libraries."
msgstr ""
"仅CPU验证检查在无Ascend设备可见时Python包能否构建。它**不**验证NPU运行时加载、\n"
"推理示例、自定义内核或NPU特定测试。仍然需要CANN工具包，\n"
"因为构建会读取其头文件和库。"

msgid ""
"Install the Python build backend and native build tools first. The editable\n"
"build uses setuptools-scm directly, and `arctic-inference` requires CMake and\n"
"Ninja when a compatible wheel is not available:"
msgstr ""
"首先安装Python构建后端和原生构建工具。可编辑\n"
"构建直接使用setuptools-scm，当没有兼容的wheel时，`arctic-inference`需要CMake和\n"
"Ninja："

msgid ""
"This build-only procedure intentionally does not install vLLM. If you continue\n"
"with combined vLLM and vLLM Ascend testing on the main branch, use the exact\n"
"vLLM commit recorded in `.github/vllm-main-verified.commit` and verify the\n"
"combined environment as described below."
msgstr ""
"此仅构建流程有意不安装vLLM。如果您继续\n"
"在主分支上进行vLLM和vLLM Ascend的联合测试，请使用\n"
"`.github/vllm-main-verified.commit`中记录的精确vLLM提交，并按如下所述验证\n"
"组合环境。"

msgid ""
"On x86, install the CPU variants of the PyTorch packages from the PyTorch CPU\n"
"index before installing the remaining Ascend dependencies:"
msgstr ""
"在x86上，在安装其余Ascend依赖之前，先从PyTorch CPU\n"
"索引安装PyTorch包的CPU变体："

msgid ""
"Set the build target explicitly and disable device backend auto-loading before\n"
"building vLLM Ascend:"
msgstr "在构建vLLM Ascend之前，显式设置构建目标并禁用设备后端自动加载："

msgid ""
"| vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-310p | Atlas 300I DUO | Ubuntu |"
msgstr ""
"| vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-310p | Atlas 300I DUO | Ubuntu |"

