"| vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-310p-openeuler | Atlas 300I DUO | "
"openEuler |"
msgstr ""
"| vllm-ascend:{{ vllm_ascend_version }}-310p-openeuler | Atlas 300I DUO | "
"openEuler |"

msgid "=== \"Atlas A2/A3/950DT inference products\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas A2/A3/950DT推理产品\""

msgid ""
"        | torch         | == 2.10.0                       | Required for "
"TorchNPU and vllm, No need to install manually, it will be auto installed in"
" below steps |"
msgstr ""
"        | torch         | == 2.10.0                       | "
"TorchNPU和vllm必需，无需手动安装，将在以下步骤中自动安装 |"

msgid ""
"Treat vLLM Ascend, vLLM, PyTorch, TorchNPU, CANN, and Triton Ascend as\n"
"    one compatibility set. For a release installation, select one complete\n"
"    row from the [release compatibility matrix](community/versioning_policy.md#release-compatibility-matrix).\n"
"    For main-branch development, use the exact vLLM commit recorded in\n"
"    `.github/vllm-main-verified.commit`; an arbitrary vLLM tag or PyPI release\n"
"    can have different transitive dependencies."
msgstr ""
"将vLLM Ascend、vLLM、PyTorch、TorchNPU、CANN和Triton Ascend视为\n"
"    一个兼容性集合。对于发布安装，请从[发布兼容性矩阵](community/versioning_policy.md#release-compatibility-matrix)中选择完整的一行。\n"
"    对于主分支开发，请使用`.github/vllm-main-verified.commit`中记录的精确vLLM提交；任意vLLM标签或PyPI发布\n"
"    可能具有不同的传递依赖。"

msgid ""
"**[Optional]** Then configure the extra-index of `pip` if you are working on"
" an x86 machine or using TorchNPU dev version:"
msgstr "**[可选]** 如果您在x86机器上工作或使用TorchNPU开发版本，请配置`pip`的extra-index："

msgid ""
"Together, the explicit build dependencies above and `requirements.txt` supply\n"
"the complete build-system requirements before the non-isolated editable\n"
"build. `--no-build-isolation` only reuses packages from the current build\n"
"environment; it does not make incompatible vLLM, PyTorch, and TorchNPU\n"
"versions compatible. Before treating an environment as runtime-capable, run\n"
"`python -m pip check` and resolve every reported conflict. Skip inference\n"
"examples and NPU-specific tests when no device is available."
msgstr ""
"上述显式构建依赖和`requirements.txt`共同提供了非隔离可编辑\n"
"构建之前的完整构建系统要求。`--no-build-isolation`仅复用当前构建\n"
"环境中的包；它不会使不兼容的vLLM、PyTorch和TorchNPU\n"
"版本变得兼容。在将环境视为可运行时之前，请运行\n"
"`python -m pip check`并解决所有报告的冲突。当没有可用设备时，跳过推理\n"
"示例和NPU特定测试。"

msgid ""
"To build custom operators, gcc/g++ higher than 8 and C++17 or higher are required. If you are using `pip install -e .` and encounter a TorchNPU version conflict, please install with `pip install --no-build-isolation -e .` to build on system env.\n"
"    If you encounter other problems during compiling, it is probably because an unexpected compiler is being used, you may export `CXX_COMPILER` and `C_COMPILER` in the environment to specify your g++ and gcc locations before compiling."
msgstr ""
"要构建自定义算子，需要gcc/g++高于8和C++17或更高版本。如果您使用`pip install -e .`并遇到TorchNPU版本冲突，请使用`pip install --no-build-isolation -e .`在系统环境中构建。\n"
"    如果在编译过程中遇到其他问题，可能是因为使用了意外的编译器，您可以在编译前在环境中导出`CXX_COMPILER`和`C_COMPILER`来指定您的g++和gcc位置。"

